'''Pai-Pai''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and can be obtained by rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] event. Her [[True Form]] was given in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]] which improves her attack rate and replaces her [[Resistant]] ability with [[Insanely Tough|Insanely Tough]]. She was later given [[Talents]] in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is unlocked in the [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] event in the '''Japanese''' version whereas in the '''Southeast Asia''' and '''International''' versions, she is unlocked in the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] banner.

