==Trivia==
*Pai-Pai is a reference to ''Magical Girl Chukana Paipai'', the ninth entry in the Toei Fushigi Comedy Series (''chūkana'' means "Chinese girl"). It was first broadcast in 1989, but didn't premiere in the west until 2020, when it was [https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL4rzcHfrDGhmye680i9STQO6hmDRmTc__ uploaded] to the Toei Tokusatsu World YouTube channel.
*Pai-Pai was added in the same update as [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|River Styx]], [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]], as though she was designed specifically to counter [[Hannya]].
*The words on her hammer mean Hóng jī ('''紅擊''') in traditional chinese, meaning Red Strike.
**Similarly, the ramen delivery box she's carrying in her first form has Māo fàndiàn ('''猫饭店''') written on it, meaning Cat Restaurant.

